<title>FRANCE: Havas Advertising 1996 sales up 7.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Havas Advertising 1996 sales up 7.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					29,112    vs   26,680</p>
<p>NOTE - Havas Advertising published the figures in the BALO official bulletin. It said that on a constant structure and unchanged exchange rates basis sales were up 7.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
